   - This is a design/capacity problem (tiny pool + 90s blocking exports), amplified by a single client hammering /dl/export. Could be abusive or just a badly-behaved scraper.

4. ETA / work in progress: No autonomous fix applied. Remediation options (restart service, raise MAX_WORKERS, move exports off the request thread, rate-limit or block 91.214.0.1) all touch availability or security policy and require admin approval. Admins should be notified. Status: CANNOT (pending admin action).

